  "FAQsSection": {
    "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "q1": {
      "question": "How can I ensure that I'm investing with a reliable company?",
      "answer": "Since 2013, we at Jumeirah Real Estate Investment have been making a difference in the Yemeni market through our pioneering projects such as Al-Hathaa Towers and Sana'a Towers. Our extensive experience, our clients' trust in us, and our close and ongoing relationship with them based on transparency and clarity make us the optimal choice for anyone looking for a safe and reliable investment."
    },
    "q2": {
      "question": "What distinguishes your properties from others in the market?",
      "answer": "Our properties combine strategic location, modern design, and high-quality execution through qualified and experienced personnel, and the use of high-quality building materials. We don't just offer apartments, but we provide integrated residential complexes with their facilities and services (gardens, private parking, earthquake-resistant structural system, health clubs, swimming pools, after-sales services... etc.) All of this makes our properties an exceptional choice that stands out from others and gives you a more luxurious life."
    },
    "q3": {
      "question": "Do you offer flexible payment methods that suit the different capabilities of clients?",
      "answer": "Yes, we provide flexible payment methods and very competitive prices, designed specifically to suit different individuals and facilitate our clients' ownership of their residential units with complete ease."
    },
    "q4": {
      "question": "Can I get a consultation before making a purchase decision?",
      "answer": "Of course. Our specialized team provides free consultations based on deep experience in the real estate market to help you make the best decision that meets your residential and investment aspirations."
    },
    "q5": {
      "question": "What if I face a problem after purchasing the property? Is there someone to follow up with me?",
      "answer": "At Jumeirah, our relationship with our clients doesn't end at the sale. We provide after-sales services including maintenance, security, and cleaning to ensure your continued comfort in the long term."
    }
  },
